{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Katana Dance</strong> is the adrenaline-fueled lovechild of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> and <strong>Hi-Fi Rush</strong> \u2014a level-based, beat-driven blood-dance where every slash, sprint, and wall-run snaps on-beat in vibrant, hand-animated arenas. No upgrades, no metagame\u2014just you, your katana, and pure, pulse-pounding tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn score</strong> by taking out enemies in style.<br><strong>Build momentum</strong> by slaying foes in time with the music, then <i>wall-run</i>, <i>jump</i>, <i>dash</i>, and <i>slide</i> to keep up the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>Infinite Mode</strong> with a custom playlist of your favorite tracks on <i>loop</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOM MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import any track via the built-in music editor and play RKD to your own soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use level files to create playlists for <i>Infinite Mode</i> or play them individually in regular levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667050?t=1757887669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667050?t=1757887669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/d0543ed5358fd2728bb574cb5740fcbb8c0aca55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757887669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/d0543ed5358fd2728bb574cb5740fcbb8c0aca55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757887669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Katana Dance</strong> is the adrenaline-fueled lovechild of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> and <strong>Hi-Fi Rush</strong> \u2014a level-based, beat-driven blood-dance where every slash, sprint, and wall-run snaps on-beat in vibrant, hand-animated arenas. No upgrades, no metagame\u2014just you, your katana, and pure, pulse-pounding tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/6444f6fb68394e2af6af73b0d40f80b2.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn score</strong> by taking out enemies in style.<br><strong>Build momentum</strong> by slaying foes in time with the music, then <i>wall-run</i>, <i>jump</i>, <i>dash</i>, and <i>slide</i> to keep up the pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>Infinite Mode</strong> with a custom playlist of your favorite tracks on <i>loop</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/99ae5f7f15619594d90715b663aee57d.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOM MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import any track via the built-in music editor and play RKD to your own soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.poster.avif?t=1757887669\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.webm?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/extras/bcc60f00437c1b0ae4f9d96c3bba310f.mp4?t=1757887669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use level files to create playlists for <i>Infinite Mode</i> or play them individually in regular levels.</p>","developers":["GETTAKE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667050/c91585fc6ba6029a199d96a4468e5168504194ea/header.jpg?t=1757887669","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175885,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175885/movie480.mp4?t=1755168156","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175885/movie_max.mp4?t=1755168156"},"name":"rkd_gameplay_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175885/e0ffa4b8dbdb28ae770c4ac147fa1337e8974dc5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755168156","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstati